DATA NOTICE: mpc

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  trace.tar.bz -> msg_sp.trace.out

What:
  The msg_sp double-precision floating-point message trace (an MPI
  application's messages), decompressed.

Source:
  Martin Burtscher's FPdouble datasets,
  https://userweb.cs.txstate.edu/~burtscher/research/datasets/FPdouble/
  msg_sp.trace.fpc decompressed with FPC (fpc.c in this directory,
  `make process`) gives exactly msg_sp.trace.out (checked 2026-11-19).

